        "original_id": "188b19b9-43ef-5a89-a7c8-fb8ac55b733f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alfred von Tirpitz, Adolf Hitler, Karl Dönitz\n- Roles: highest possible naval rank, head of government of Germany\n\nFacts:\n- During World War II, Adolf Hitler was the head of government of Germany.\n- Karl Dönitz briefly succeeded Adolf Hitler as the head of government of Germany.\n- Karl Dönitz attained the highest possible naval rank in Germany.\n- Alfred von Tirpitz had previously held that highest possible naval rank before Karl Dönitz later replaced him in that distinction.",
