        "original_id": "7b7044cd-4b5d-5bff-9702-f1f1fc69b31e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Erich Raeder, Alfred von Tirpitz, Karl Dönitz, Adolf Hitler\n- Roles: Großadmiral, head of state of Germany\n\nFacts:\n- In 1939, Erich Raeder attained the highest possible naval rank, Großadmiral (Grand Admiral).\n- Erich Raeder was the first person to hold the rank of Großadmiral since Alfred von Tirpitz.\n- Karl Dönitz briefly succeeded Adolf Hitler as the head of state of Germany.",
